    title: "java: encryption.yaml carries ONE java sanitizer row (javax.crypto.Cipher.doFinal) -- add the plaintext->ciphertext and key_material->derived_key rows and count same-function sanitizer sites on a real java repo, which is what re-ranks WI-gotun"  # fa92
